== 1 -h: exit 0
p
Multiplies.

usage: p [--times <i64>] [--be-loud] [--small <u8>] [--big <u64>] [--rate <f64>] [--maybe <i32?>] <a> [<rest>...]

arguments:
  <a>                  i64; requires `a > 0`
  <rest>               Vec[String]

options:
  --times <i64>        i64, default 4
  --be-loud            bool, default false
  --small <u8>         u8, default 0
  --big <u64>          u64, default 0
  --rate <f64>         f64, default 0.0
  --maybe <i32?>       i32?, default null
  -h, --help           prints this help
